{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1670.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"24f5c4c71d64a79bf384ea0e621cb45181767ff02d37e9393bedc6aafd554e42","ja":"「いい感じで盛り上がってますね。それじゃあ\nそろそろ衣装に着替えてもらっていいですか？」","zh":"「气氛热烈得正正好呢。那么\n差不多可以请您换上服装了吗？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1670.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"92f21b3bd5c8bfc79a4d7b9cd8fb3ca9d086007902a5854085cccd600d65fc0a","ja":"あっ、はい。本番ですね。\nそれじゃあ、行こ！","zh":"啊，好的。要正式开始了呢。\n那么，我们走吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
